| Tool                              | PowerShell command                                               |
| --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Node.js LTS                       | `winget install OpenJS.NodeJS.LTS`                               |
| Azure Functions Core Tools v4     | `npm install -g azure-functions-core-tools@4 --unsafe-perm true` |
| Azure Functions VS Code Extension | `code --install-extension ms-azuretools.vscode-azurefunctions`   |
| C# Dev Kit                        | `code --install-extension ms-dotnettools.csdevkit`               |
| C# Extension                      | `code --install-extension ms-dotnettools.csharp`                 |
| Azurite VS Code Extension         | `code --install-extension Azurite.azurite`                       |
| Git                               | `winget install Git.Git`                                         |
| Azure CLI                         | `winget install Microsoft.AzureCLI`                              |
| Power Platform CLI                | `dotnet tool install --global Microsoft.PowerApps.CLI.Tool`      |
